One small saving grace - Monsters tend to heal slower than players and
players get stronger with experience faster than monsters (mostly
because
players face many monsters but monsters only face the player and your
pets so they have less chance to gain experience).

A monster will only use the wand if it knows it's in trouble.  At some
point you'll be able to get within range of the monster and kill it
with
thrown daggers before it has a chance to drop down another hole.  Of
course once the wand is used up the monster will zap it and not fall
through so there's a higher chance you'll get a used up wand than one
still having charges.  The harder you hit the higher the chance the
wand
still has charges.


